\ A raise inside a `choose` predicate, pinned eager. The compiled `choose` intrinsic inlines
\ the predicate invocation, so the chain carries the `choose` row at the call site but not the
\ prelude-internal `call` row an interpreted run shows. The interpreted twin is
\ error_frames_choose.1z; the AOT suite builds this file and diffs the same golden.

pick-bigger: ( a b -- x ) [ [ + 0 > ] choose 0 + ] ;

1 "x" pick-bigger .
